:: AdultSectionBlake [nobr] {"position":"3000,1750","size":"100,100"}
<<image "characters/blake/blake-shop.jpg" { class: "displayCentredImgs", width: "50%" }>><br>

<<if setup.Mall.blakeUnlocked()>>
	<<if setup.Mall.blakeFirstMeeting()>>
		<<say>>You <<= setup.Mc.name()>>?<</say>><br>
		<<mc>>Depends.<</mc>><br>
		<<say>>Alice said you'd say that. I'm Blake. She talks about you.<</say>><br>
		<<thought>>From her coy smile and building blush, you suspect the conversation wasn't strictly professional.<</thought>><br>
		<<run setup.Mall.setBlakeDialogStage(0)>>
		<<if setup.Mall.blakeCanIntroduceCursedItemBuyback()>>
			<<include "BlakeCursedItemOffer">>
		<<else>>
			<<say>>A lot of men seem to walks into those houses, but you're one of the few women who keep making it out. Good. That'd be such a waste of a pretty face.<</say>><br>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<say>>Hi <<= setup.Mc.name()>>, need any help?<</say>><br>
		<<if setup.Mall.blakeCanIntroduceCursedItemBuyback()>>
			<<include "BlakeCursedItemOffer">>
		<</if>>
		<<if setup.Mall.blakeHasCursedItemToSell()>>
			<<linkreplace "@@.usebtn;Give her the cursed item@@">>
				<<say>>Thanks, gorgeous. Here's your money. Feel free to bring more, I'll gladly buy them from you.<</say>><br>
				Money: +60 $ <br>

				<<if setup.Mall.canRaiseBlakeRelationship()>>
					<<run setup.Mall.raiseBlakeRelationship()>>
					@@.mc-speech; Relationship with Blake increased: now <<= setup.Mall.blakeRelationship()>>!@@
				<</if>>
				<<run setup.Mall.sellCursedItemToBlake()>>
			<</linkreplace>>
		<<else>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>

<<else>>
	<<say>>Hi ,need any help?<</say>><br>
	<<mc>>No, thanks, I'm just looking around.<</mc>><br>
<</if>>

<<if setup.Mall.blakeIsCompanionCandidate()>>
	<<if setup.Mall.blakeHuntFinishedAlone()>>
		@@.mc-speech; [[Ask her how her ghost hunt went.|BlakeHuntEndAlone]]@@<br>
	<<else>>
		@@.mc-speech;<<link "Ask Blake to join you for ghost hunting tonight.">>
			<<run setup.Mall.pickBlakeForHunt()>>
			<<replace "#blakeInfoAnswer">><<mc>>I want you to join me for ghost hunting today<</mc>><br>
				<<say>>Yes, of course. I'll be ready. Let's meet by the entrance to the haunted house. <br>
					But if we find the cursed item, I'll keep it, okay?
				<</say>><br>
				<<mc>>Fine, let's do that.<</mc>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>@@<br>

		<span class="CompanionInfoAskForHuntAlone">
		@@.mc-speech;<<link "I'd like you to go ghost hunting alone.">>
			<<replace "#blakeInfoAnswer">><<say>>I think I'm already experienced enough to do it on my own. Where should I go?<</say>><br>

				@@.enterbtn;<<link `"Owaissa Street - " + setup.Mall.chanceBlakeAloneOwaissa() + " %"`>>
					<<run setup.Mall.pickBlakeForSoloHuntOwaissa()>>

					<<if setup.Mc.money() lt 20>>
						<<replace "#blakeInfoAnswerTwo">>@@.warningtext; I don't have enough money to buy her a contract @@
						<</replace>>
					<<else>>
						<<replace "#blakeInfoAnswerTwo">><<say>>Owaissa Street? Hmm... Yes, of course. I think I can handle it.<</say>>
						<</replace>>
					<</if>>
				<</link>>@@

				@@.enterbtn;<<link `"Elm Street - " + setup.Mall.chanceBlakeAloneElm() + " %"`>>
					<<run setup.Mall.pickBlakeForSoloHuntElm()>>
					<<if setup.Mc.money() lt 20>>
						<<replace "#blakeInfoAnswerTwo">>@@.warningtext; I don't have enough money to buy her a contract @@
						<</replace>>
					<<else>>
						<<replace "#blakeInfoAnswerTwo">><<say>>Elm Street? Hmm... Yes, of course. I think I can handle it.<</say>>
						<</replace>>
					<</if>>
				<</link>>@@@@color: green; <b>-20$</b>@@<br>

				<span id="blakeInfoAnswerTwo">

				</span>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>@@<<if setup.Companion.companionLvl('Blake') lt 2>>
			@@.warningtext; Req. Blake's lvl 2+@@
		<</if>></span>

		<br>
		<span id="blakeInfoAnswer">

		</span>

	<</if>>

	<br>

	<<if setup.Companion.companionLvl('Blake') lt 2>>
		<<done>>
			<<addclass ".CompanionInfoAskForHuntAlone" "disabled-link">>
		<</done>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br>
<br>
@@.backbtn; [[Back|AdultSection]]@@

:: BlakeCursedItemOffer {"position":"3000,1750","size":"100,100"}
<<say>>I heard you and the witch trade in objects nobody else wants. Heavy in the hand without looking heavy? The ones that make a room feel wrong?<</say>>
<<mc>>Or very right...<</mc>>
<<mc>>Some of them. I bring them to her.<</mc>>
<<say>>I pay more.<</say>>
<<mc>>Why?<</mc>>
<<say>>My patrons aren't all here for the inflatables. They're here for my shelf in back that has a waiting list. If I keep that shelf full, my rent gets paid.<</say>>
<<mc>>I don't think that Khadija would like that.<</mc>>
<<say>>She won't be told. Or she will and she'll be over it in a week. She's a big girl.<</say>>
<<mc>>I'll think on it.<</mc>>
<<say>>Think quicker than you usually do. I tend to get bored of my toys fast.<</say>>

@@.mc-action;Now you can bring cursed items to the adult store and sell them for a higher price.@@
<<run setup.Mall.setBlakeDialogStage(1)>>
